<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-011>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-011" ;
  triage:title "Sprint plan docs not updated for validate_runtime_socket_path migration" ;
  triage:description "Sprint plan docs (sprint-S1.md and plan-phase-S.md) still list validate_runtime_socket_path as a code target in crates/atm-daemon/src/composition.rs, but the function was migrated out of that location on the boundary-extraction branch. All five worktrees contain stale doc references. Overlaps ATM-QA-003 (blocking, covers both code and docs); ATM-QA-011 narrows scope to the docs-only traceability gap." ;
